                <head>No. 117.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Noyes to Mr. Evarts</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Received <date calendar="gregorian"
                            type="received-date" when="1878-05-31">May 31,
                    1878</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris.</hi></placeName>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Evarts</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>France has assent of all members Latin Union, except Italy, which is telegraphed
                    for to-day, whose answer France awaits. * * *</p>
                <closer><signed>NOYES.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
